2.1 Requirements
================

Before installing ‘dired-video-thumbnail’, ensure you have:

   • Emacs 28.1 or later
   • ‘ffmpeg’ and ‘ffprobe’ installed and available in your ‘PATH’

   To verify ‘ffmpeg’ is installed, run:

     ffmpeg -version


